    "title_en": "Infrared Problem in Quantum Electrodynamics",
    "abstract_en": "It is well known that the inclusive cross section in QED is infrared finite. In the standard diagram techniques this result follows from cancellation of infrared divergences. We construct a new diagram technique where the diagrams for inclusive cross sections (and, more generally, for inclusive scattering matrix) do not contain infrared divergences.",
